From c16c3da9c4dee55771fcd69a091a65c73f405268 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bluebunny <bluebunny@postmarketos.org>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 19:40:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 031/107] main/postmarketos-config-nftables: allow Docker
 bridge networks

Docker containers configured to use the bridge driver can't access
the Internet because Docker uses virtual networks with the prefix
'br-'. As such, outbound packets from such containers are dropped
mysteriously. Fix by adding a forward rule.

Signed-off-by: bluebunny <bluebunny@postmarketos.org>
Part-of: <https://gitlab.nura.eco/nura/pmaports/-/merge_requests/9864>
---
 main/postmarketos-config-nftables/APKBUILD            | 6 +++---
 main/postmarketos-config-nftables/rules/51_docker.nft | 1 +
 2 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/main/postmarketos-config-nftables/APKBUILD b/main/postmarketos-config-nftables/APKBUILD
